  <!-- EN: toxic buildup -->
  <VEF_ToxicBuildup.label>中毒</VEF_ToxicBuildup.label>
  <!-- EN: Toxins in the bloodstream. This can come from various sources, including environmental toxins, venomous bites, or poisoned weapons.\n\nAt high doses, toxic buildup is lethal. Even at low doses, it can generate cancers.\n\nContrary to base game toxic buildup, creatures who die with this toxic damage can be eaten. -->
  <VEF_ToxicBuildup.description>流淌在血液裡的毒素。可能來自各種環境，包含環境的毒、毒咬、或有毒武器。\n\n中毒過深會致死。即使中毒不深，也會產生毒瘤。\n\n與原版相反，死於這種中毒狀態的生物可以食用。</VEF_ToxicBuildup.description>
