  <!-- EN: hypothermic slowdown -->
  <VFEP_HypothermicSlowdown.label>低溫凍結</VFEP_HypothermicSlowdown.label>
  <!-- EN: Dangerously low core body temperature. Unless re-warmed, hypothermic slowdown gets worse and ends in death. Recovery is quick once the victim is re-warmed. -->
  <VFEP_HypothermicSlowdown.description>長時間暴露於急凍粒子下導致的患者體內溫度平衡失調狀態。低溫凍結會在患者進入溫暖的地方後隨著時間的推移自然恢復。但如果患者繼續暴露在急凍粒子下，低溫凍結會變得更嚴重，直到患者死亡。</VFEP_HypothermicSlowdown.description>
